==================================================================================
SO THE LIST IS DEAD AS A CLASS, AND THE CLASS IS NAMEABLE
==================================================================================
  Not one of the eleven references electric charge, and not one rests on a quantity that
  vanishes identically. Every single failure was a charge-blind balance -- which is
  exactly the conjunction constraints (A) and (B) forbid.

  That is worth more than eleven separate autopsies. The failures were not eleven bad
  ideas; they were one bad class explored eleven ways, and the corpus's own later work
  -- the neutrino forward test and the screening weight -- says why the class cannot work.

  What the constraints demand together: a CHARGE-COUPLED quantity that VANISHES
  IDENTICALLY. That is the shape of an anomaly-cancellation or index condition, and the
  corpus already carries two objects of exactly that shape for unrelated reasons --
  str[k1] = 0 (Pauli finiteness) and sum Q^2 = 16 over the roster.

  Not a mechanism. A named class with two members already in the building, which is what
  the sector has lacked since 2026-07-17: every attempt since then has drawn from the
  class the evidence excludes.

==================================================================================
THE HONEST LIMIT
==================================================================================
  The three charged leptons all carry Q = -1, so no charge-weighted sum over them
  vanishes on its own -- sum Q = -3, sum Q^2 = 3. A working mechanism must therefore
  couple charge to something else that distinguishes the seats, and the family grading
  is not available for that (its Z3 charge commutes with chirality; the identification
  died on Nielsen-Ninomiya). So the class is named and its first obstacle is already
  visible, which is the honest state: a direction, not a derivation.
